        "thinking": "I'm identifying the root युछँ as bhvādi, parasmaipada, seṭ, meaning \"to go/depart.\" With tuk augment before च-initial affixes per 6.1.73, the present form becomes युच्छति.\n\nFor the aorist, since this is a seṭ root, I check whether vṛddhi applies — 7.2.4 blocks it when iṭ follows, and since u here is followed by two consonants (guru), laghūpadha guṇa doesn't apply either. So the iṭ aorist comes out as अयुच्छीत्.\n\n",
